 result={'verdict':'accepted','summary':'No current failure demonstrated. Ten complete source banks replay exactly; independent math, native grading, delivery, rendering and decision-role checks pass. All five runner records survive. Package unchanged.','source_analysis':{k:source[k] for k in ('skill','reasoning_steps','invariants','permitted_variations','source_refs','evidence_paths')},'checks':{},'findings':[]}
 checks={
 'source_replay':(['source-analysis.json','source-replay-results.json','source-replays.json'],'Ten supported prompts, worked solutions and complete five-choice banks replay exactly. Two incomplete unrated captures and canonical missing answer field are explicitly documented gaps.'),
 'math':(['math-results.json','review.py','all-records.json'],'197 records independently checked with exact Fraction arithmetic, executing all 985 bank operations and validating solution matrices, final operations and changed-row prose. Post-normalization records rechecked.'),
 'variety':(['sampling-domain.json','boundary-records.json','fresh-sample.json','resampling-results.json','rejection-witness.json','stage-coverage.json'],'Ten bank profiles and all 48 eligible answer roles covered; boundary perturbations, row permutations, fresh seed, rejection/resampling and delivered coverage verified.'),
 'scope':(['source-analysis.json','scope-results.json','controlled-records.json'],'One-step elementary row identification and five-choice radio contract remain at moderate workload. Conservative finite numeric scope documented.'),
 'grading':(['native-input.json','native-results.json','delivered-native-input.json','delivered-native-results.json'],'Native grader: 197 accepted/788 rejected raw responses; 187 accepted/748 rejected normalized delivery responses, zero unresolved. Every choice tested; no free-entry fields occur.'),
 'rendering':(['render/rendering.json','render-remaining/rendering.json','render-inspection.json','render-records.json'],'Eleven actual UI previews pass. Representative screenshots inspected for matrices, fractions, controls, worked solutions and both controlled pair kinds.'),
 'packaging':(['runtime-results.json','author-regressions.json','legacy-fixed-bank-results.json','package-integrity.json','inventory-audit.json','affected-inventory.json'],'Declared closure runs relocated; Python 3.13.5/SymPy 1.14.0 match exact manifest pins. Legacy format/wrapper/fixed-key failures reproduced; current regressions and deterministic CLI counts pass. Package remains byte-identical.'),
 'decision_variation':(['pedagogical-variation.json','counterfactual-results.json','shortcut-results.json','action-shortcut-results.json','stage-coverage.json','selection-results.json','batch-delivery/delivery.json'],'Fixed-A alternative targets and irrelevant-row edits track prompts, explanations and real grading. All 48 eligible choices survive actual filters. No reproducible incidental shortcut found in tested banks or exact five-record batch. Selection conclusions are conditional on supplied-rule scenarios; live learner state absent.')}
 for name,(paths,details) in checks.items():
  assert all((E/p).is_file() and (E/p).stat().st_size>0 for p in paths)
  result['checks'][name]={'status':'passed','evidence_paths':paths,'details':details}
 save('review-result.json',result);save('evidence-contract.json',{'passed':True,'pedagogical_schema':schema_method,'sample_refs_nonempty_and_relative':True,'eight_checks_have_nonempty_evidence':True,'package_unchanged':True,'result':'review-result.json'})
 (E/'session-state.md').write_text('Review complete: accepted; no demonstrated current defects. Independent source account precedes package inspection. Source replay 10 complete banks; exact math on 197 raw records; native 197 accepted/788 rejected and normalized 187/748; delivery 182/197 audit and 5/5 exact batch; all 48 eligible roles survive; 11 actual UI previews and representative screenshots inspected. Legacy CLI/wrapper/fixed-bank defects reproduced and current regression/relocation checks pass. Package snapshot unchanged. Pedagogical schema and relative nonempty sample refs verified. See review-result.json; source gaps and live-selection limits retained.\n')
